{"text": "BERNIE BROS ON CAMPUS\n\nJESSICA and CHARLOTTE walk together on a college campus.\nBoth stop when they notice MATT wearing a \"People for\nBernie\" T-shirt and suit jacket with a campaign button on\nthe front.\n\nJessica and Charlotte stay back so Matt can't see them.\n\nCHARLOTTE\nOh, hey, Molly, another Bernie Bro.\n\nMOLLY\nYeah, Charlotte, they're\neverywhere! You can't walk across\nany of the quads without running\ninto them.\n\nCHARLOTTE\nI know. And, if you don't want to\ntalk to them, they make some\ncomment about how you probably\nsupport Hillary, like you're\ngarbage to want a woman president.\n\nMOLLY\nHey, let's hang back here and watch\nfor a little bit. Maybe we catch\nhim harassing someone and we can\nspread it all over Twitter. Expose\nthese misogynist pigs once and for\nall.\n\nCHARLOTTE\nI have class in twenty minutes, but\ndefinitely. Let's get this\nbrogressive.\n\nMATT approaches two students walking together, CHAD and\nLIZZY. Molly pulls out her phone and points it toward Matt.\n\nMATT\nHello, mind if I take a moment to\ntalk to you about feeling the Bern\ntoday?\n\nLIZZY\nWe're kind of going somewhere.\n\nMATT",
